sequenceDiagram
    actor 教师
    participant 前端
    participant PaperController
    participant PaperService
    participant AuditLogMapper
    participant MessageMapper

    教师->>前端: 提交论文
    前端->>PaperController: POST /paper/add
    PaperController->>PaperService: createPaper(dto)
    PaperService->>PaperService: save(paper) status=1
    PaperController-->>前端: 返回成功
    前端-->>教师: 提交成功

    Note over 教师,MessageMapper: === 秘书审核阶段 ===

    秘书->>前端: 审核论文(通过)
    前端->>PaperController: POST /paper/audit {pass:true}
    PaperController->>PaperService: auditPaper(dto)
    PaperService->>PaperService: updateById status=2
    PaperService->>AuditLogMapper: insert(审核日志)
    PaperService->>MessageMapper: insert(审核结果消息)
    PaperController-->>前端: 审核完成

    Note over 教师,MessageMapper: === 院长终审阶段 ===

    院长->>前端: 终审论文(通过)
    前端->>PaperController: POST /paper/audit {pass:true}
    PaperController->>PaperService: auditPaper(dto)
    PaperService->>PaperService: updateById status=3
    PaperService->>AuditLogMapper: insert(审核日志)
    PaperService->>MessageMapper: insert(审核结果消息)
    PaperController-->>前端: 终审完成

    MessageMapper-->>教师: 收到审核结果通知
